WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.150
William Bludworth is the mysterious Mt. Abraham
medical examiner in the Final Destination

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.280
franchise, that seems to know a little bit
too much about Death.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.499
The movies provide us with more questions
than answers about this character, leading

00:00:10.499 --> 00:00:13.360
fans to come up with their own theories and
speculations.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.540
Is he the incarnation of Death itself?

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.540
Is he the Devil?

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.960
Or is he something else entirely?

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.821
In this video I’ll be going over his entire
known history to bring you the answers, so

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:25.270
if you want to find out, stick around to the
end of this video.

